ing.html'\">立即预约合适套餐</button>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<footer>\n    © 2026 洁家家政 | 北京市朝阳区建国路88号 | 电话：010-1234-5678\n</footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n===== FILE: about.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>关于我们 - 洁家家政</title>\n    <style>\n        body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:#f9f9f9;color:#333;}\n        header{background:#2c7be5;color:#fff;padding:20px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;}\n        header h1{margin:0;font-size:24px;}\n        nav a{color:#fff;margin-left:20px;text-decoration:none;font-size:16px;}\n        nav a:hover{opacity:0.8;}\n        .content{max-width:1000px;margin:30px auto;padding:40px;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;}\n        h2{font-size:32px;margin-bottom:20px;}\n        .team{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;}\n        .member{flex:1 1 200px;background:#f0f4f8;padding:20px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;}\n        .member img{width:100px;height:100px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;margin-bottom:10px;}\n        .member h4{margin:5px 0;}\n        .member p{font-size:14px;color:#555;}\n        footer{background:#333;color:#ccc;padding:20px 40px;text-align:center;font-size:14px;}\n        @media(max-width:768px){\n            header{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;}\n            nav{margin-top:10px;}\n            .team{justify-content:center;}\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n    <h1>洁家家政</h1>\n    <nav>\n        <a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n        <a href=\"services.html\">服务项目</a>\n        <a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a>\n        <a href=\"booking.html\">预约清洁</a>\n    </nav>\n</header>\n\n<div class=\"content\">\n    <h2>关于洁家家政</h2>\n    <p>洁家家政成立于2015年，致力于为北京地区的家庭提供专业、可靠的清洁服务。我们深知现代都市生活的忙碌，凭借多年经验的清洁团队、严格的质量管理体系以及环保的清洁用品，为每一位客户打造洁净、健康的居住环境。</p>\n\n    <h3 style=\"margin-top:30px;\">我们的使命</h3>\n    <p>让每一个家庭都能享受无忧的居家生活，让清洁不再是负担。</p>\n\n    <h3 style=\"margin-top:30px;\">核心价值</h3>\n    <ul>\n        <li>专业 – 持续培训，保持行业领先水平。</li>\n        <li>诚信 – 明码标价，服务透明。</li>\n        <li>安全 – 使用绿色环保产品，保障家庭健康。</li>\n        <li>满意 – 100%客户满意度承诺。</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3 style=\"margin-top:30px;\">团队成员</h3>\n    <div class=\"team\">\n        <div class=\"member\">\n            <img src=\"data:image/png;base64,</div>\n            <h4>王丽娜</h4>\n            <p>创始人 / 首席运营官<br>拥有10年家政管理经验，曾在多家大型家政公司担任高层。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"member\">\n            <img src=\"data:image/png;base64,</div>\n            <h4>李强</h4>\n            <p>资深清洁主管<br>专业培训师，负责团队技术提升与质量监督。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"member\">\n            <img src=\"data:image/png;base64,</div>\n            <h4>张敏</h4>\n            <p>客户服务经理<br>负责客户需求对接，确保服务体验满意。</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<footer>\n    © 2026 洁家家政 | 北京市朝阳区建国路88号 | 电话：010-1234-5678\n</footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n===== FILE: booking.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>预约清洁 - 洁家家政</title>\n    <style>\n        body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:#f9f9f9;color:#333;}\n        header{background:#2c7be5;color:#fff;padding:20px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;}\n        header h1{margin:0;font-size:24px;}\n        nav a{color:#fff;margin-left:20px;text-decoration:none;font-size:16px;}\n        nav a:hover{opacity:0.8;}\n        .content{max-width:800px;margin:30px auto;background:#fff;padding:40px;border-radius:8px;}\n        h2{font-size:28px;margin-bottom:20px;}\n        form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;}\n        label{display:block;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:5px;}\n        input, select, textarea{width:100%;padding:8px;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:4px;font-size:14px;}\n        textarea{resize:vertical;height:100px;}\n        .full{grid-column:1 / -1;}\n        .submit{background:#ffb400;color:#333;padding:12px 20px;border:none;border-radius:4px;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer;}\n        .submit:hover{background:#e6a200;}\n        .note{font-size:14px;color:#777;margin-top:10px;}\n        footer{background:#333;color:#ccc;padding:20px 40px;text-align:center;font-size:14px;margin-top:40px;}\n        @media(max-width:600px){\n            header{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;}\n            nav{margin-top:10px;}\n            form{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\n        }\n    </style>\n    <script>\n        function submitForm(event){\n            event.preventDefault();\n            alert('感谢您的预约，我们将尽快联系您！');\n            // Reset form fields\n            document.getElementById('bookingForm').reset();\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n    <h1>洁家家政</h1>\n    <nav>\n        <a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n        <a href=\"services.html\">服务项目</a>\n        <a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a>\n        <a href=\"booking.html\">预约清洁</a>\n    </nav>\n</header>\n\n<div class=\"content\">\n    <h2>在线预约清洁服务</h2>\n    <form id=\"bookingForm\" onsubmit=\"submitForm(event)\">\n        <div>\n            <label for=\"name\">姓名</label>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" placeholder=\"请输入您的姓名\" required>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n            <label for=\"phone\">手机号码</label>\n            <input type=\"tel\" id=\"phone\" name=\"phone\" placeholder=\"请输入手机号码\" required pattern=\"[0-9]{11}\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"full\">\n            <label for=\"address\">服务地址</label>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"address\" name=\"address\" placeholder=\"北京市朝阳区...\" required>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n            <label for=\"date\">预约日期</label>\n            <input type=\"date\" id=\"date\" name=\"date\" required>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n            <label for=\"time\">预约时间段</label>\n            <select id=\"time\" name=\"time\" required>\n                <option value=\"\">请选择时间段</option>\n                <option>08:00 - 12:00</option>\n                <option>12:00 - 16:00</option>\n                <option>16:00 - 20:00</option>\n            </select>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"full\">\n            <label for=\"package\">选择套餐</label>\n            <select id=\"package\" name=\"package\" required>\n                <option value=\"\">请选择套餐</option>\n                <option>基础清洁套餐 - ¥120 / 次</option>\n                <option>深度清洁套餐 - ¥260 / 次</option>\n                <option>全屋保洁（每周） - ¥800 / 月</option>\n                <option>全屋保洁（每两周） - ¥450 / 月</option>\n                <option>增值专项服务（自定义）</option>\n            </select>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"full\">\n            <label for=\"remarks\">备注（可填写特殊需求）</label>\n            <textarea id=\"remarks\" name=\"remarks\" placeholder=\"例如：宠物、特殊清洁部位等\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"full\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"submit\">提交预约</button>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"note full\">我们承诺将在24小时内与您取得联系确认预约详情。</p>\n    </form>\n</div>\n\n<footer>\n    © 2026 洁家家政 | 北京市朝阳区建国路88号 | 电话：010-1234-5678\n</footer>\n</body>\n</html>",
